<title>UK: Lonrho sells unit to De La Rue.</title>
<headline>Lonrho sells unit to De La Rue.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Conglomerate Lonrho Plc said on Tuesday that it is selling Harrison and Sons Ltd to printing and security products group De La Rue Plc.  </p>
<p>It said in a statement that De La Rue will buy the company for a nominal payment but will assume around 18 million stg of debt.</p>
<p>Lonrho expects to make a profit of around two million stg on the disposal.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
